   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Project aims to Ensure the continuity of the supplementary medical services through the provision of 2 transformers for 2 health centers in AL Daliah and Wadi AL Qalaa. In addition to increasing the sense of safety within the city, especially for women and young girls. and facilitated safe movement and increase the sense of safety for the residents inside the city especially at night. In addition to focusing on the inner neighborhoods and linking them with the main street of the city. More</narrative>
